  {
    "id": 3007009030010,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "『──はい』",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300700903/3007009030010"
  },
  {
    "id": 3007009030020,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "あっ、もしもしさくやん？\r\n三峰でーす、こんばんはっ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300700903/3007009030020"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "bg": "00270",
    "bgEffect": "fade",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 3000
  },
  {
    "id": 3007009030030,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "遅い時間にごめんね～\r\n今大丈夫？",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charType": "characters",
    "charId": "007",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "from",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/300700903/3007009030030"
  },
  {
    "id": 3007009030040,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "『こんばんは、結華\r\n私の時間は大丈夫だけれど──……』",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300700903/3007009030040"
  },
  {
    "id": 3007009030050,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "『珍しいね、結華から電話なんて』",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300700903/3007009030050"
  },
  {
    "id": 3007009030060,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "ふふー、たまにはね？",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300700903/3007009030060"
  },
  {
    "id": 3007009030070,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "というより、早く伝えたいなぁってことがあってさ",
    "charAnim1": "think",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300700903/3007009030070"
  },
  {
    "id": 3007009030080,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "『おや\r\nそれは興味深いな』",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300700903/3007009030080"
  },
  {
    "id": 3007009030090,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "でしょでしょ？\r\n聞いてくださいよさくやん",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300700903/3007009030090"
  },
  {
    "id": 3007009030100,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "──あのね\r\n家族からさ、クリスマスカードの返事が来たの",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300700903/3007009030100"
  },
  {
    "id": 3007009030110,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "こっちは１枚しか出してないのにさ、\r\n両親も兄さんも弟も、バラバラに寄越しちゃって",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300700903/3007009030110"
  },
  {
    "id": 3007009030120,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "『フフ……それはそれは』",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300700903/3007009030120"
  },
  {
    "id": 3007009030130,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "おっかしいでしょー？\r\n妙に張りきっちゃってるのバレバレだっていう！",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300700903/3007009030130"
  },
  {
    "id": 3007009030140,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "……だけどさ、やっぱり嬉しかったんだよね\r\nああ、カード送ってよかったんだなぁって",
    "charAnim1": "think",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300700903/3007009030140"
  },
  {
    "id": 3007009030150,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "それもこれもさくやんのアドバイスのおかげ！\r\nだから早くお礼が言いたくて",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300700903/3007009030150"
  },
  {
    "id": 3007009030160,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "ありがとう、さくやん",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300700903/3007009030160"
  },
  {
    "id": 3007009030170,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "『お役に立てたのなら──\r\nそれはとても嬉しいことだけれど』",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300700903/3007009030170"
  },
  {
    "id": 3007009030180,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "『結華の気持ちがあればこそ、じゃないかな』",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300700903/3007009030180"
  },
  {
    "id": 3007009030190,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "言うと思った～～\r\nそうやっていつも謙遜するんだもん",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300700903/3007009030190"
  },
  {
    "id": 3007009030200,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "だから今回は反撃を用意したんだなぁ",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300700903/3007009030200"
  },
  {
    "id": 3007009030210,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "『反撃？』",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300700903/3007009030210"
  },
  {
    "id": 3007009030220,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "そ！",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300700903/3007009030220"
  },
  {
    "id": 3007009030230,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "──まぁ、三峰の気持ちがうちの家族に届いたから\r\n喜ばれたんだとしましょう",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300700903/3007009030230"
  },
  {
    "id": 3007009030240,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "でも、あの時さくやんとたまたま会って、\r\nさくやんが背中を押してくれてなかったら！",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300700903/3007009030240"
  },
  {
    "id": 3007009030250,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "三峰は家族にカードなんて送ってないんだよねぇ\r\n多分、クリスマスプレゼント自体途中で諦めてたし",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300700903/3007009030250"
  },
  {
    "id": 3007009030260,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "──ということはつまりー？",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300700903/3007009030260"
  },
  {
    "id": 3007009030270,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "『……つまり？』",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300700903/3007009030270"
  },
  {
    "id": 3007009030280,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "さくやんのおかげで三峰の気持ちが届いたし、\r\nそれでうちの家族が喜んだし",
    "charAnim1": "think",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300700903/3007009030280"
  },
  {
    "id": 3007009030290,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "家族が喜んだことを三峰も喜んでる、という\r\n今の状況になるわけです！",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300700903/3007009030290"
  },
  {
    "id": 3007009030300,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "さくやんの功績、大きいでしょ？",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300700903/3007009030300"
  },
  {
    "id": 3007009030310,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "『……──』",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300700903/3007009030310"
  },
  {
    "id": 3007009030320,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "はい、ここまでで何か質問は？",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300700903/3007009030320"
  },
  {
    "id": 3007009030330,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "『……結華はどうして……\r\nそんなに私を褒めてくれるんだろうか』",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300700903/3007009030330"
  },
  {
    "id": 3007009030340,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "それはねぇ、ちょっと悔しかったからです",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300700903/3007009030340"
  },
  {
    "id": 3007009030350,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "『うん……？』",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300700903/3007009030350"
  },
  {
    "id": 3007009030360,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "この間の買い物の時、さくやんってば\r\n三峰の心ドンピシャのアドバイスくれちゃったじゃん？",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300700903/3007009030360"
  },
  {
    "id": 3007009030370,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "それなのに、たいしたことしてないよ～みたいに\r\n振る舞われちゃったら困るからさぁ",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300700903/3007009030370"
  },
  {
    "id": 3007009030380,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "ここはひとつ、さくやんの偉大さを\r\n他ならぬさくやん自身に理解してもらわねば、的なね？",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300700903/3007009030380"
  },
  {
    "id": 3007009030390,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "だから、さくやんありがとう、と",
    "charAnim1": "think",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300700903/3007009030390"
  },
  {
    "id": 3007009030400,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "もっかい言うけど、三峰もうちの家族もハッピーに\r\nしてくれたきっかけは、さくやんです",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300700903/3007009030400"
  },
  {
    "id": 3007009030410,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "『──……結華、ありがとう……！\r\n気持ちは十分伝わったよ』",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300700903/3007009030410"
  },
  {
    "id": 3007009030420,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "ほんとに？　大丈夫？",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300700903/3007009030420"
  },
  {
    "id": 3007009030430,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "三峰、信頼できるある筋から、\r\n『気取らずに、気構えずに』──",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300700903/3007009030430"
  },
  {
    "id": 3007009030440,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "『三峰の素直な想いを込める』のが大事って\r\n教わったんだけど、足りてる？",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_close2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300700903/3007009030440"
  },
  {
    "id": 3007009030450,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "『ああ、足りているさ……！』",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300700903/3007009030450"
  },
  {
    "id": 3007009030460,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "そっかぁ、じゃあいいかなぁ……\r\n三峰、こういうの得意じゃないから加減がわかんなくて",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300700903/3007009030460"
  },
  {
    "id": 3007009030470,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "──さくやんには本当に感謝してるんだよ？",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300700903/3007009030470"
  },
  {
    "id": 3007009030480,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "『～～……！』",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300700903/3007009030480"
  },
  {
    "id": 3007009030490,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "あはは、うんうん\r\n三峰今ので満足かな！",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300700903/3007009030490"
  },
  {
    "id": 3007009030500,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "『……素直な結華は、特別素晴らしい』",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300700903/3007009030500"
  },
  {
    "id": 3007009030510,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "拗ね方が可愛らしくて素直だと特別素晴らしいんじゃ、\r\n三峰、さくやんに特攻持ちだね？",
    "charAnim1": "think",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300700903/3007009030510"
  },
  {
    "id": 3007009030520,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "『フフ……まったくだ』",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300700903/3007009030520"
  },
  {
    "id": 3007009030530,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "じゃあ、満足したところでそろそろ失礼しようかな──",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300700903/3007009030530"
  },
  {
    "id": 3007009030540,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "『あ──』",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300700903/3007009030540"
  },
  {
    "id": 3007009030550,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "うん？　どしたの？",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300700903/3007009030550"
  },
  {
    "id": 3007009030560,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "『──……いや、なんでも──』",
    "textCtrl": "p",
